        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Advance degree credit for placement on the salary schedule shall be as provided below:",
            "block_bbox": [
                76,
                107,
                505,
                143
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    76.0,
                    107.0
                ],
                [
                    505.0,
                    107.0
                ],
                [
                    505.0,
                    143.0
                ],
                [
                    76.0,
                    143.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The teacher applying for credit for an advanced degree will provide an official college transcript of record showing the award of the earned degree to the Personnel Department.",
            "block_bbox": [
                98,
                144,
                504,
                198
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    98.0,
                    144.0
                ],
                [
                    504.0,
                    144.0
                ],
                [
                    504.0,
                    198.0
                ],
                [
                    98.0,
                    198.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. If the transcript does not indicate the date on which the degree was awarded, the teacher will provide additional confirmation that the degree was awarded by either:",
            "block_bbox": [
                97,
                199,
                504,
                252
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    97.0,
                    199.0
                ],
                [
                    504.0,
                    199.0
                ],
                [
                    504.0,
                    252.0
                ],
                [
                    97.0,
                    252.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) an updated transcript showing the date of the award;",
            "block_bbox": [
                121,
                257,
                491,
                276
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
